    stage2_generic_tail_unwrap_reboxes_record_2026-11-19, 0, "2026-11-19 ROOT-FIXED+STAGE2-GATED (PR #11912 / 133ccb53409). Erased generic -> T bodies calling .unwrap() / if val / match on Option (T?) previously left the extracted T local unmarked, so function_lowering boxed records via rt_value_int_wide (Stage 3 MIR/LLVM SIGSEGV) and double-boxed i64. Root-fixed in src/compiler/50.mir (method_calls_literals.spl, expr_dispatch.spl, switch_operators_calls.spl); concrete typed payload owners tagged @workaround bug=stage2_generic_tail_unwrap_reboxes_record_2026-11-19 at expr_dispatch.spl:86 (_sffi_hir_expr_payload_req) and core_codegen.spl:218 (_sffi_*_payload_req) remain Stage-2-gated until Stage 2 seed is rebuilt past 162c481782f. Evidence: doc/08_tracking/bug/stage2_generic_tail_unwrap_reboxes_record_2026-11-19.md."

